<h1>UnSelEntity</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Unselects specific entity.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Type</i></b> – type of the entity or name of the group to which the entity belongs. See <u><a href="../type_conventions.htm" style="font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;"><font>Type Conventions</font></a></u> for details.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Name</i></b> – name of the entity.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><i style="font-style:italic;">group/entity &gt; Unselect All</i> from the tree context menu.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode"><font style="font-family:Courier New;" face="Courier New">UnSelEntity( Type="PtStripe", Name="Scan data" )</font></p>
